# Launcher split, move L5 (docs/engine/modularization_plan.md, Part C section 20): the Admin page's data and worker
# (AdminJob, AdminData, AdminWorker; the end of Part C section 18), reports ("Report ..." for players, messages, posts,
# listings and servers; Admin > Reports; "Report cheating"), the Admin page and the ban banner (launcher/main.cpp
# 12207-13217 at the base) -> launcher/AdminPage.hpp / .cpp.
# Check it with (on the move commit):
#   python3 scripts/check_pure_move.py --base HEAD~1 --head HEAD --source launcher/main.cpp \
#       --dest launcher/AdminPage.hpp --dest launcher/AdminPage.cpp --dest launcher/LauncherShared.hpp \
#       --rules docs/engine/moves/L5_admin_page.rules
# The Marketplace listing-type table (struct MktKind, kMktKinds, kMktKindN: constants, used by main.cpp and the Admin
# page) moved unchanged from main.cpp into LauncherShared.hpp.
#
# main.cpp: `static` dropped on what the moved code uses (declared in LauncherShared.hpp); OpenPublicProfile's default
# arguments move to its declaration in LauncherShared.hpp and main.cpp's forward declaration of it goes; the forward
# declarations of OpenReport, DrawReportPopup and DrawAcReportPopup are replaced by AdminPage.hpp; the moved
# forward declaration of DrawOfficialAdmin (defined later in main.cpp) is replaced by LauncherShared.hpp.
# The moved code: `static` dropped on what main.cpp calls (declared in AdminPage.hpp).
